  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Fisheries and Improving the Quality of Life for Artisanal Fisherman in the Chaco</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASOPECHA will work toward the conservation of fisheries along the Paraguay River and its tributaries and better income for its 567 fisher members. ASOPECHA will also construct three stations for filleting fish in compliance with provincial standards, which will allow fishers in three communities to add value to their catch before it is marketed. It will also improve its own advocacy, management and organizational skills and further develop Red de Pesca, a regional network of fishers.</narrative>
  </description>
